msgid ""
"<qt><h3>Reply-To addresses</h3><p>This sets the <tt>Reply-to:</tt> "
"header to contain a different email address to the normal <tt>From:</tt> "
"address.</p><p>This can be useful when you have a group of people working "
"together in similar roles. For example, you might want any emails sent to have "
"your email in the <tt>From:</tt> field, but any responses to go to a group "
"address.</p><p>If in doubt, leave this field blank.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""

