#: kmmsgpartdlg.cpp:88
msgid ""
"<qt><p>The <em>MIME type</em> of the file:</p><p>normally, you do not need to "
"touch this setting, since the type of the file is automatically checked; but, "
"sometimes, %1 may not detect the type correctly -- here is where you can fix "
